{"id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbpoly.md","title":"Canonical multilinear representation","display":"thm-pbpoly — Canonical multilinear representation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbpoly","aliases":["27-thm-pbpoly"],"display":"thm-pbpoly — Canonical multilinear representation","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.2","source_statement":"Theorem 13.1 and Möbius coefficient formula","source_printed_pages":"571","source_pdf_pages":"595","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbpoly"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbpoly</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbpoly — Canonical multilinear representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.1 and Möbius coefficient formula"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"571"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f\">\\(c_f\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>）。空积取 1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;\\left(f(\\chi_A)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq A}c_f(S)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;\\left(f(\\chi_A)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq A}c_f(S)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.1 的存在性证明用 minterm 插值再展开补变量，本次核对了陈述与证明。也可直接交换有限和：固定 A 后，内层和为 (1−1)^{|A\\B|}，仅 B=A 时为 1；因此在每个 characteristic vector 上得到 f(χ_A)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"ta