a8a7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$、$\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$（see [[27-df-pbnf]]），$c_f$ 及多线性表示（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"},{"id":"1d0e29e9558d4e2f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]）；q 的规范多线性表示（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"}],"outgoing":["7937ecc11ac59760"]}